  profileId: motivation.profile.power.mid
  profileLabel: Power Mid Motivation
  survivalNeed: Working power can make nearby water safer and more controllable.
  survivalNeedWeight: 1.05
  resourceNeed: Its value comes through systems and recovery, not simple pickups.
  resourceNeedWeight: 0.85
  engineeringNeed: This area invites diagnosing lines, relays, loads, and failed
    links.
  engineeringNeedWeight: 1.5
  curiosityPull: Visible energy chains should make the player want to see where they
    begin and end.
  curiosityPullWeight: 1
  storyPull: Power routes imply old use, current failure, and places that once mattered.
  storyPullWeight: 0.95
  rareValuePull: Rare value comes from restoring leverage over a difficult pocket
    of world.
  rareValuePullWeight: 1.05
  optionalityRule: These pulls are invitations, not requirements; the player decides
    which one matters today.
  returnRule: The area should stay worth revisiting later with a different goal,
    toolset, or tolerance for risk.
  ownershipRule: The player should feel they built their own reasons to come back
    here.
